flowchart LR
    User([Người dùng]) --> App[Agent Core\nsrc/app.py]

    subgraph Agent[ReAct Agent Loop]
        App --> Prompt[System Prompt\n+ User Query]
        Prompt --> Provider[LLM Provider\nsrc/providers.py]
        Provider --> Decision{LLM phân tích\nquyết định}
        Decision -->|Trả lời trực tiếp| Final[Final Answer]
        Decision -->|Native tool_call| Action[Tool name\n+ arguments]
        Observation[Observation từ tool] --> Synthesis[Tổng hợp kết quả]
        Synthesis --> Final
    end

    subgraph Native[Native Tool Definitions]
        Schema[TOOLS_SCHEMA\nJSON Schema]
        ToolTrip[trip_planning]
        ToolStay[search_accommodations]
    end

    Provider -. "Nhận schema để gọi native tools" .-> Schema
    Schema --> ToolTrip
    Schema --> ToolStay
    Action --> MCP[MCP Client/Server\nsrc/mcp_server.py]
    MCP --> Router[dispatch_tool_call]
    Router --> ToolTrip
    Router --> ToolStay
    ToolTrip --> Data[(Mock Database\nsrc/tools.py)]
    ToolStay --> Data
    Data --> MCP
    MCP --> Observation
    Final --> User

    Provider -. "API lỗi hoặc thiếu key" .-> Mock[MockOfflineProvider]
    Mock --> Decision

